--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Files in this package derived from the upstream sources, and modified
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

lib/src/assertions.dart
    The assertion names and their meanings follow LocatorAssertions,
    PageAssertions and APIResponseAssertions of @playwright/test
    (toBeVisible, toHaveText, toHaveCount, ...). The implementations are
    written from scratch in Dart against this port's public API, the set is
    smaller, and the retry loop is this port's own.

lib/src/fixtures.dart
    The browser/context/page fixture shape follows @playwright/test's, but
    the lifecycle is built on package:test rather than on a runner of its
    own. The README states that difference explicitly.
